# MY FILE EXPLORER – SOFTWARE TEST CASES

## 1. Project Overview

**Project Name:** My File Explorer

**Objective:** To develop a browser-based file management application that allows users to create, upload, organize, edit, preview, and manage files and folders.

**Storage:** IndexedDB (browser storage)

**Testing Type:** Manual Functional Testing, UI Testing, Negative Testing and Data Persistence Testing.

## 2. Test Cases

### Module 1: Create Files and Folders

| TC ID | Test Scenario | Expected Result |
|---|---|---|
| TC001 | Open the application. | File Explorer should open successfully. |
| TC002 | Click New Folder and enter a valid folder name. | A new folder should be created. |
| TC003 | Create a folder without entering a name. | Folder should not be created. |
| TC004 | Create two folders with the same name in the same location. | Duplicate folder name should not be allowed. |
| TC005 | Click New Text File and enter a filename. | A new text file should be created. |
| TC006 | Create a text file without entering an extension. | The system should automatically add .txt. |

